<title>BERMUDA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA IN TROUBLE VS NZ IN TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA IN TROUBLE VS NZ IN TEST.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, New Zealand 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, chasing 326 runs to win the second test against New Zealand, were in trouble by the close of play on Sunday, losing two wickets for just 20 runs.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 222</p>
<p>Second innings 273 (B.Young 62, S.Fleming 59, N.Zoysa 3-53)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings 170</p>
<p>Second innings 20 for two (D. Vettori 1-4).</p>
</text>
